Hello,

I'm having troubles with mounting (attaching even) an erased or
ubiformated device:

after

	ubiformat /dev/mtd4

I get the dump below. This happens on an i.MX35 based machine, mtd4 is a
complete nand chip. I also tried v3.6-rc2 +
git://git.infradead.org/mtd-2.6#master +
git://git.infradead.org/users/dedekind/l2-mtd-2.6#master without any
change in behaviour.

Is this a known problem? Anything else but bisecting?

Best regards
Uwe

